# Optional. With a public Mapbox token (pk.*), the map uses Mapbox GL JS and the
# Mapbox Dark basemap. Without it, the app falls back to MapLibre GL JS with the
# CARTO Dark Matter basemap (or a plain dark background if offline).
# Use a URL-restricted *public* token only. Never put a secret (sk.*) token here:
# anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the browser JavaScript.
VITE_MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=
